{"4887530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "White Clouds", "steam_appid": 4887530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>White Clouds — A Cozy Mountain Meditation Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887530/extras/883f230d4d467039a87a2b68f6db3475.poster.avif?t=1786963447\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887530/extras/883f230d4d467039a87a2b68f6db3475.webm?t=1786963447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887530/extras/883f230d4d467039a87a2b68f6db3475.mp4?t=1786963447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High in the mountains, where the clouds touch the earth, you find an old, abandoned house - and begin a new life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>White Clouds</strong> is a quiet, slow-paced game about a person who leaves the hustle and bustle of the world behind and climbs into the mountains to find themselves. Discovering a dilapidated house nestled among the peaks, you slowly and lovingly breathe life back into it. You clean the yard, repair the walls, and plant flowers - finding joy not in the final result, but in the process itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, spirituality is not an abstraction. It is the patience with which you stack log upon log. It is the mindfulness with which you watch the fog drift through the valley. It is the joy of a simple moment, lived with awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887530/extras/7ea352f1f6d3547821ffd365fb9c2409.poster.avif?t=1786963447\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887530/extras/7ea352f1f6d3547821ffd365fb9c2409.webm?t=1786963447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887530/extras/7ea352f1f6d3547821ffd365fb9c2409.mp4?t=1786963447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restoring the Home:</strong> Bring the walls back to life, clear away the ruins, and arrange your living space step by step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haiku Poetry:</strong> Compose haikus inspired by the breathtaking landscapes - each poem becomes a snapshot of a fleeting moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Caring for Nature:</strong> Tidy up the surrounding area, plant flora, and discover cozy, hidden spots around your home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meditation Spots:</strong> Unlock special places in the mountains for watching the sunrise, stargazing, or simply sitting in silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887530/extras/3d3383ca3769c7f4a82e263fa4c0d1c3.poster.avif?t=1786963447\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887530/extras/3d3383ca3769c7f4a82e263fa4c0d1c3.webm?t=1786963447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887530/extras/3d3383ca3769c7f4a82e263fa4c0d1c3.mp4?t=1786963447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tea &amp; Landscapes:</strong> Brew a cup of tea and admire the view — a simple moment filled with pure tranquility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilgrims:</strong> Travelers will visit your sanctuary. You can share your wisdom, offer them shelter, and meditate together.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Spirit of the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no rivals and no rush here. Every single action is a meditation. Time flows slowly, like the clouds drifting over the peaks. As you grow internally, the entire world around you blossoms. Nature responds to your inner peace with its outer beauty, and the pilgrims carry your wisdom further into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>White Clouds</strong> is a game for anyone who has ever dreamed of escaping to the mountains to find themselves.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>White Clouds — A Cozy Mountain Meditation Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887530/extras/883f230d4d467039a87a2b68f6db3475.poster.avif?t=1786963447\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887530/extras/883f230d4d467039a87a2b68f6db3475.webm?t=1786963447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887530/extras/883f230d4d467039a87a2b68f6db3475.mp4?t=1786963447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High in the mountains, where the clouds touch the earth, you find an old, abandoned house - and begin a new life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>White Clouds</strong> is a quiet, slow-paced game about a person who leaves the hustle and bustle of the world behind and climbs into the mountains to find themselves. Discovering a dilapidated house nestled among the peaks, you slowly and lovingly breathe life back into it. You clean the yard, repair the walls, and plant flowers - finding joy not in the final result, but in the process itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, spirituality is not an abstraction. It is the patience with which you stack log upon log. It is the mindfulness with which you watch the fog drift through the valley. It is the joy of a simple moment, lived with awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887530/extras/7ea352f1f6d3547821ffd365fb9c2409.poster.avif?t=1786963447\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887530/extras/7ea352f1f6d3547821ffd365fb9c2409.webm?t=1786963447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887530/extras/7ea352f1f6d3547821ffd365fb9c2409.mp4?t=1786963447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restoring the Home:</strong> Bring the walls back to life, clear away the ruins, and arrange your living space step by step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haiku Poetry:</strong> Compose haikus inspired by the breathtaking landscapes - each poem becomes a snapshot of a fleeting moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Caring for Nature:</strong> Tidy up the surrounding area, plant flora, and discover cozy, hidden spots around your home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meditation Spots:</strong> Unlock special places in the mountains for watching the sunrise, stargazing, or simply sitting in silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887530/extras/3d3383ca3769c7f4a82e263fa4c0d1c3.poster.avif?t=1786963447\" width=800 hei